| `apps/web/hooks/useAnalytics.ts`, `apps/web/hooks/useFeatureFlags.ts` | PostHog analytics. |
| `apps/web/components/Analytics*` (if any) | UI analytics widgets. |
| `apps/web/providers/PostHogProvider.tsx` | Provides the PostHog context – not needed. |
| `apps/web/ee/**` (any “Enterprise‑only” code) | License‑check, premium‑only features. |

> **Caution:** Some UI pages import these modules, so after removal you may need to delete the corresponding imports or guard them with `process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production'` checks to avoid build errors.

