## 📦 TL;DR – Minimal self‑hosted stack

| Layer | Implementation |
|------|----------------|
| **Database** | PostgreSQL / SQLite (any Prisma‑compatible). |
| **Email provider** | Google OAuth **or** Microsoft OAuth (or both). |
| **Queue** | *Optional* – you can run without QStash; background jobs become no‑ops. |
| **Analytics / Billing** | *Optional* – strip PostHog / Stripe / Resend. |
| **Env** | Only `DATABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, Google/Outlook OAuth vars are required. |
| **Run** | `pnpm dev` → UI → “Load Stats” → messages appear in `EmailMessage` table. |

If you later decide you want any of the removed features (e.g., premium subscription gating or digest emails), just re‑introduce the corresponding env vars and the code will work out‑of‑the‑box.

