### 🙋‍♀️ Need more help?

* **“I want to keep QStash but run it locally.”** – You can spin up a local Upstash emulator (Docker image `upstash/qstash`) and point `QSTASH_URL` to it. The existing `publishToQstash*` helpers will work unchanged.
* **“I don’t want any background queue at all.”** – Replace `publishToQstash` with a tiny wrapper that just does `await fn()`; the rest of the code path stays the same.
* **“Can I replace Resend with plain SMTP?”** – Swap `@inboxzero/resend` import for a small wrapper around `nodemailer.sendMail`. The function signatures (`sendDigestEmail`, `sendSummaryEmail`) are simple – just copy the call‑sites and feed the same `from`, `to`, and `emailProps`.

Feel free to ask if you’d like a concrete code snippet for any of those substitutions!
